        <mxCell id="note1" value="&#8226; coaching_schedule = jantung pakej (mingguan: bimbingan + aktiviti + bekalan + mod)&#10;&#8226; supplies[] paut ke inventori (item_id / kit_id) &#8594; auto-tolak stok&#10;&#8226; Pakej aktif blok pakej berbayar baru (elak double-billing)&#10;&#8226; Aktifkan = auto-jana pelan rawatan dari coaching_schedule&#10;&#8226; package_id auto-format M### (mis. M001)&#10;&#8226; Mod setiap minggu: f2f / online / both" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="784" y="378" width="412" height="252" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

